@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
title Behaviour - Retry a temporary provider failure
autonumber
actor "Job scheduler" as actor
box "Backend - Sycapooke Worker" #D1FADF
 participant "RetryPendingRefundsJob" as entry
end box
box "Backend - Sycapooke Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
 participant "RetryPendingRefundsHandler" as handler
 participant "Refund" as model
end box
box "Backend - Sycapooke Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
 database "Feature state / unit of work" as db
end box
participant "Payment provider" as provider
actor -> entry : Retry a temporary provider failure
entry -> handler : Authenticate session or signed callback
handler -> db : Load authorized current state
db --> handler : Current state
alt Access, validation or state check refuses the action
 handler -> handler : Preserve state and return domain refusal
else Authorized and valid action
handler -> handler : Load pending refund and original payment [L2-030]
handler -> provider : Use the persisted refund ID as idempotency key
provider --> handler : Confirmed result or temporary failure
handler -> handler : Record confirmation; finalize associated pending support refund atomically
handler -> db : Commit valid state and outbox atomically
db --> handler : Result
end
handler --> entry : Result or domain refusal
entry --> actor : One confirmed full refund; temporary failure remains pending
note over entry, handler
One confirmed full refund; temporary failure remains pending
end note
note over handler, db
A pending support problem stays Open until confirmed issuance.
Confirmation closes that problem and applies Refunded once.
Cancellation orders remain Cancelled with an Issued refund.
end note
@enduml
